"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Caught off-guard, ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ spun around, confused, in search of the source."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫突如其来的声音让「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」很诧异。"

#: search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e65377fe3c103c89d97099ea849ddc56e6c41c499435f7acf987792a7a04058
