msgctxt "search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where you looking?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m over here. Yeah, there you go.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Little more to the "
"left."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在看哪里呢？⟪k:1⟫来来来，⟪k:2⟫在这边。⟪k:3⟫对了，⟪k:4⟫向左转。"

#: search:search_49F955BE_4E05_4E8D_ABE8_12721B082B88
