msgstr "⟪k:0⟫画里传来了声音……"

#: search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2becfabef4afb8ce83eff2bc874052b517c09bdb95d575610f88a56f0a302bb8
