msgctxt "search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ had passed by this wall on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ way to "
"the third door,⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫ ⟪k:10⟫a magnificent landscape painting had been hanging there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫以前由女仆带着经过这幅画的时候，⟪k:1⟫上面确实画着的是美丽风景。"

#: search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc66178e9f7ef9ffcfe06049064d23acc7649bca103fa6eeeca0552d76b1a811
#. default-sha256: 68439860a54d72fbe2df4b7a2c0cbd506f99540441880fd9237440228d37b18e
msgctxt "search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But now, the canvas was a deep shade of black, as if it had been dipped into a vat of ink."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然而现在，⟪k:1⟫却染成了像被墨涂过般的黑色。"

#: search:search_E274FD87_12D4_4405_8215_FA3F45F727AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beb23eda20abc3cafe956e0e82e12490a6aacfd4b9af3ac8a53e64df5b1357fa
