msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: search:search_51712C12_CBA0_4DDD_A7DB_6DCDE8268617
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a15e1af6c0e9f4ce7d892da1249818fd31b05330ba1bf178c7c6299c41dd1d27
