msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The painting sounded rather high-spirited."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫画里的声音，⟪k:2⟫总觉得好像激动得有些颤抖。"

#: search:search_E8290194_3DEE_4D82_BDBC_11AEFAFF25F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407ef6e5d96df87fad68db259cafc6d2f1035a9425b0de8ea09794cabd887654
